# Ripgrep exclusions for code search (Claude Code's Grep/Glob use ripgrep).
# These paths are dead, generated, or archived — excluding them keeps searches on
# actual application source. Files here remain readable; only search skips them.
#
# node_modules/, coverage/, build output, .claude/worktrees/ and snapshot zips are
# already excluded via .gitignore, which ripgrep honours.

frontend/archive/
docs/archive/
reference/
test-results/
playwright-report/
.playwright-mcp/
*.zip
